&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;margin-top:1.5pt;margin-bottom:1.5pt;line-height:14.5pt;"&gt;転炉２基を新設&lt;/p&gt;
